    "system": {
      "description": {
        "value": "<p>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you mark an enemy within 30 feet. Until the end of your turn, all Crimson Rite damage you deal to the target is doubled.</p>\n               <p><strong>Amplify:</strong> The target also loses resistance to your active rite damage type until the end of your turn.</p>",
