        "value": "<p>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, curse a target within 30 feet. Must succeed on a Constitution save or have disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity checks for 1 minute. If it makes more than one attack in a turn, it takes 1d8 necrotic damage.</p>\n               <p><strong>Amplify:</strong> Damage increases to 2d8 necrotic.</p>",
