        "value": "<p>As a <strong>Reaction</strong> when a creature with a soul drops to 0 HP within 30 feet, you absorb its essence to gain advantage on your next attack roll, ability check, or save.</p>\n               <p><strong>Amplify:</strong> You also regain hit points equal to one roll of your Hemocraft die.</p>",
